screen.XRAY=X-ray Toggles
screen.VIS=Vision & Visuals
screen.ADV=Advanced
screen.XRAY.comment=Show entities, chests and beds through walls
screen.VIS.comment=Night vision, entity shadows, and target brightness / fog
screen.ADV.comment=F1 panic key and debug tint

option.XRAY_PLAYERS=Player X-ray
option.XRAY_PLAYERS.comment=Applies to the whole entity pass using the original method. Mobs, dropped items and arrows come along
option.XRAY_CHESTS=Chest X-ray
option.XRAY_CHESTS.comment=Chests, ender chests, barrels, shulker boxes and other block entities (signs, banners and beacon beams come along)
option.XRAY_BEDS=Bed X-ray
option.XRAY_BEDS.comment=All 16 bed colours through walls (single bed before 1.12)

option.NAMETAG_BG=Name Plate
option.NAMETAG_BG.comment=Style of the black box behind nametags. The vanilla translucency reads as solid black here, so dropping it is an option
value.NAMETAG_BG.0=Vanilla
value.NAMETAG_BG.1=Hidden
value.NAMETAG_BG.2=Translucent

option.NIGHT_VISION=Night Vision
option.NIGHT_VISION.comment=Render the whole world at full brightness; no torches needed underground
option.NO_ENTITY_SHADOW=Remove Entity Shadows
option.NO_ENTITY_SHADOW.comment=Drops the vanilla blob shadow so no dark patch follows entities while x-ray is on
option.XRAY_FULLBRIGHT=Fullbright Targets
option.XRAY_FULLBRIGHT.comment=Only the x-rayed entities / chests / beds ignore the lightmap; the rest of the world is untouched
option.XRAY_NOFOG=No Fog On Targets
option.XRAY_NOFOG.comment=Keep distant targets from fading into the fog colour

option.XRAY_F1_PANIC=F1 Panic Off
option.XRAY_F1_PANIC.comment=Hiding the HUD with F1 also turns every x-ray off, handy before a screenshot
option.XRAY_DEBUG=Debug Tint
option.XRAY_DEBUG.comment=Paints every fragment classified as an x-ray target magenta. No magenta means it did not match

profile.ALL=All On
profile.OFF=All Off
profile.comment=Toggle every x-ray and night vision option at once
